            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaye ariwo ŋina ayai kidiama ŋakyes kec, ayai ibore ŋini ekwaan ka ekicoloŋ ŋolo ka apolou, atakani itiyaunitae a amoru a ŋinapus a ŋina enyaritae Sapire. Eboi alokicoloŋ a ŋol etorube ŋolo ekwaan ka ŋolo a ituŋanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ eŋolek ibore ŋini asibit acir keŋ alokidiama anakuwan a etorube a ŋol, atakani ikwaan ka asuwat ŋina enepi ŋina eyai nakim; ameun a nen tari kwap keŋ, atakani esibit akim. Ayai etorube ŋol kidiŋ akica ŋina akwaŋan kya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekoni akica ŋin ileere neni ileereo alokakinet apaki ŋina eyakar akiru tocai akoloŋ. Ayai etorube ŋol kidiŋ akica ŋin. Arae ŋol etakane ŋolo ka apolou a ŋina ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eŋolikini ayoŋ akica ŋin, abu omin kwap, oper obuburiyar, eiira etoil a ice irworo neni kaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
